          "settings": {
            "always_open": false,
            "show_lines": true,
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "collapsible_tabs_size": "label_font_uppercase",
            "text": "<p>A refreshing functional drink crafted with a blend of natural botanical extracts. Elderberry, ginger, and turmeric work together to support your daily balance while delivering a smooth, easy-to-enjoy taste.</p><p>Light, clean, and thoughtfully formulated, it’s designed to fit effortlessly into your routine—whether you need a moment of focus, a gentle boost, or a way to reset.</p><p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Elderberry Extract, Ginger Extract, Turmeric Extract</p><p><strong>Volume:</strong> 500 ml</p><p><strong>Calories:</strong> approx. 80–120 kcal</p>",
