            "icon": "package_closed",
            "link_text": "Payment & Shipping",
            "link_size": "label_font_uppercase",
            "show_lines": true,
            "text": "<h2>Payment Methods</h2><p>We accept all major credit and debit cards, including Visa, Mastercard, and American Express. You can also use convenient digital payment options such as Apple Pay, Shop Pay, and PayPal.<br/></p><h2>Shipping Destinations</h2><p>We currently ship to the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, and selected European countries.<br/>Delivery times may vary depending on your location.<br/><br/>For security reasons, we are unable to deliver to P.O. boxes or freight forwarding addresses.<br/></p><h2>Shipping Notes</h2><p>Orders are processed within 1–2 business days.<br/>Delivery times depend on your location and selected shipping method.<br/><br/>Please note that shipping times may be slightly longer during peak periods.<br/></p><h2>Delivery Partners</h2><p>We work with trusted global carriers such as DHL, FedEx, and local delivery services to ensure your order arrives safely and on time</p>",
