    "c666685e-eae5-4bed-a42a-b6be470546bf": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--18483371475218__c666685e-eae5-4bed-a42a-b6be470546bf-168191958504581bd7-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "heading": "{Wellness That Fits Your Everyday Life}",
            "heading_size": "heading_xl",
            "heading_color": "gradient",
            "heading_gradient": "linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 50%, rgba(101, 101, 101, 1) 100%)",
            "text": "<p>The balance between taste, performance, and design makes it feel like something you naturally reach for every day, whether you’re working, traveling, or just trying to stay focused. It doesn’t feel like a supplement—it feels like part of your lifestyle. Plus, it looks as good as it feels.”</p>",
            "text_size": "default",
            "autor_name": "",
            "autor_position": "",
            "autor_size": "default",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--18483371475218__c666685e-eae5-4bed-a42a-b6be470546bf-168191958504581bd7-0": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "heading": "The ingredient list is clear, minimal, and purposeful",
            "heading_size": "heading_xl",
            "heading_color": "gradient",
            "heading_gradient": "linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 50%, rgba(101, 101, 101, 1) 100%)",
            "text": "<p>“The ingredient list is clear, minimal, and purposeful, which makes it easy to understand exactly what you’re consuming and why it’s there. Performance feels consistent rather than overstated. It integrates naturally into a daily routine, whether used in the morning, during work sessions, or in moments when focus needs a subtle boost.”</p>",
            "text_size": "default",
            "autor_name": "",
            "autor_position": "",
            "autor_size": "default",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--18483371475218__c666685e-eae5-4bed-a42a-b6be470546bf-168191958504581bd7-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "heading": "Elevated Everyday Essentials",
            "heading_size": "heading_xl",
            "heading_color": "gradient",
            "heading_gradient": "linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 50%, rgba(101, 101, 101, 1) 100%)",
            "text": "<p>“A refined take on functional drinks that feels both modern and intentional. Clean ingredients, balanced formulas, and a minimalist aesthetic make it stand out in a crowded category. It’s wellness, reimagined with style.”</p>",
            "text_size": "default",
            "autor_name": "",
            "autor_position": "",
            "autor_size": "default",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_wmV3eR": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "heading": "Clean, Intentional, Effective",
            "heading_size": "heading_m",
            "heading_color": "solid",
            "heading_gradient": "linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 50%, rgba(101, 101, 101, 1) 100%)",
            "text": "<p>“A refreshing approach to daily wellness, built around simplicity and purpose. Each drink feels considered, from ingredients to effect, without overcomplicating the experience. It’s the kind of ritual you want to keep.”</p>",
            "text_size": "default",
            "autor_name": "",
            "autor_position": "",
            "autor_size": "default",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_ezGFpy": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "heading": "Where Wellness Meets Performance",
            "heading_size": "heading_s",
            "heading_color": "solid",
            "heading_gradient": "linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 50%, rgba(101, 101, 101, 1) 100%)",
            "text": "<p>“Positioned at the intersection of lifestyle and functionality, this brand delivers a well-rounded product experience. It balances clean formulation with consistent results, appealing to both wellness-focused and performance-driven consumers. A strong contender in the modern beverage space.”</p>",
            "text_size": "default",
            "autor_name": "",
            "autor_position": "",
            "autor_size": "default",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
